---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { skills, education, site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="About" description="Background, skills and education.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>About me</h1>
      <p class="lede">I grew up in Sweden, study in Karlskrona, and I like it best when a model is small, fast and honest about what it looked at.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>I’m in the last part of an MSc in engineering in AI and machine learning at Blekinge Institute of Technology. Most of my serious work has been in defence: computer vision for a counter-drone interceptor we built with FMV and the Marine Technology Center, and navigation for drones when GPS is jammed.</p>
      <p>What ties it together is verification. A high score on a test set isn’t enough for me. I use SHAP, Grad-CAM and LIME to see <em>why</em> a model decides what it decides, and more than once that has shown the model was cheating.</p>
      <p>Outside school I tinker. I self-host the tools I would otherwise pay for, run local models on a 4 GB GPU, and build experiments like a team of small AI agents that mostly argue with each other.</p>
      <p>I’m a Swedish citizen and available for security vetting. Swedish is my first language, and I’m fluent in English.</p>
    </div>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">What I work with</h2>
      <dl class="rows">{skills.map((s) => <div><dt>{s.area}</dt><dd>{s.items}</dd></div>)}</dl>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 style="margin-bottom:0.75rem">Education</h2>
      <p style="margin:0 0 1.5rem"><strong>{education.degree}</strong><br /><span class="muted">{education.school}, {education.years}. {education.detail}</span></p>
      <dl class="rows">{education.courses.map((c) => <div><dt>{c.area}</dt><dd>{c.items}</dd></div>)}</dl>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 style="margin-bottom:0.75rem">Work with me</h2>
      <p class="prose">I’m looking for work in AI, sensor systems or software development, especially in the defence industry. The fastest way to reach me is <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>email</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
